          {
            "title": "Class",
            "id": 89034,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per aggiungere codice alla classe, rientriamo rispetto alla parola chiave <code>class</code>, come nell'istruzione <code>print()</code> qui.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;inside the class&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"40\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"inside the class\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>print</code>, seguito da <code>\"inside the class\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Class",
            "id": 89036,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Creare una variabile all'interno di una classe funziona proprio come creare variabili normali. Deve avere il rientro corretto e un valore assegnato.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  nationality = \" /><text value=\"&quot;French&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"38\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>, seguito da <code>\"French\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Creare una variabile all'interno di una classe funziona proprio come creare variabili normali. Deve avere il rientro corretto e un valore assegnato.</p><p>Assegna a <code>nationality</code> il valore <code>\"French\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  nationality = \" /><text value=\"&quot;French&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"French\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>, seguito da <code>\"French\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Class",
            "id": 89347,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo aggiungere tutte le variabili che vogliamo all'interno di una classe, come la variabile <code>hobby</code> con il valore <code>\"Cooking\"</code> qui.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  nationality = \" /><text value=\"&quot;French&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  hobby = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Cooking&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"58\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>\"Cooking\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
